Package: mergerfs-panel
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Recommends: mergerfs
Description: Two-panel GTK4 manager for mergerfs pools
 MergerFS Panel lists the filesystems on the machine and the mergerfs pools
 that are currently mounted, and lets the user add a disk as a live branch by
 dragging it onto a pool. Pools and branches can be dragged back to the disks
 panel to unmount or remove them.
 .
 Disks are mounted through UDisks2 with the usual polkit authentication, and
 branches are managed through mergerfs' runtime xattr interface, so no root
 helper is required.
